@startuml
actor Customer
participant Web as "Next.js Web"
participant API as "NestJS API"
database DB as "PostgreSQL"

Customer -> Web: Select item(s)
Web -> API: POST /orders
API -> DB: Save order
DB --> API: Order created
API --> Web: Order confirmation
Web --> Customer: Show confirmation
Customer -> Web: Submit payment
Web -> API: POST /payments
API -> DB: Record payment
DB --> API: Payment saved
API --> Web: Payment success
Web --> Customer: Show receipt
@enduml
